{"v":4,"catch":"令人驚嘆的 3D 感覺，邀請您參加一場未知的戰鬥！","desc":"《SENJYO》是TEHKAN（KOEI TECMO GAMES）於1983年發售的一款射擊遊戲。\n使用屏幕底部的雷達搜索，用你自己的雙激光炮摧毀從 360 度接近的太空坦克。\n摧毀 32 個太空坦克以進入下一輪。\n\n“Arcade Archives”系列忠實再現了許多經典的Arcade傑作。\n玩家可以改變各種遊戲設置，例如遊戲難度，並且還可以重現那時的街機顯示設置的氛圍。 玩家也可以通過高分來與世界各地的選手展開競爭。\n請享受為視頻遊戲打造一代的傑作。","publisher":"HAMSTER","release":"2023-01-12","genres":["射擊","街機"],"players":"單機 1–2 人","langs":["日文","英文","西班牙文","法文","德文","意大利文"],"pmax":2,"poff":2,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.1GB / Switch 0.1GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/c41f803f0a1aac4663d165207f5eb73675dc7af02340789ed1d62b28faf7defe.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/8b409850c6bd65542c77f22093f99f073073389fc314eae8ccf44ced7d206bcc.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/0a1ca48b39f7e0ce593af81c4f3dcbe4d5d1ca8ba5736f91d0a908923acc8bd1.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/7c2a753b2223a08f63eca30f08c60c2685689cf0b23cb3efc08cd2f50a539f83.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/85a7314a30d1f95f3fb746a6afe2d2be5b9d7bfbc96f97645b0fb2fec86b5026.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/3c1922d90c550ac0760798738045d2c1cc5edf7000fb4afc4aa52dfc96551d7b.jpg"],"titleId":"0100bf8019fec000","dlc":[]}